description: |
    The minimal requirement for the test :term:`runner` is now
    Python 3.12. Please make sure that you are using a supported
    Python version on the system running ``tmt`` or use one of our
    `container images`__. Note that this change does not affect in
    any way :ref:`guest-compatibility`, i.e. the System Under Test
    where tests are being executed.

    __ https://quay.io/organization/teemtee/
